tolome-calamares-settings (0.1.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Keyboard: the layout chosen in Calamares is now first and "fon" second
    (e.g. fr,fon), so that the password typed during installation matches the
    login screen, the lock screen and the console. XKBVARIANT and XKBOPTIONS
    are kept.
  * Installed system only: drop the fixed GNOME input sources from the system
    dconf database so that the session follows /etc/default/keyboard.
  * Add tests/test-set-keyboard.sh.

 -- Anhky <dev@tolome.net>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0100

